In 1973, several rock bands and artists had significant chart success, but the band with the most number one hits in that year was **The Rolling Stones**. Their song &quot;Angie&quot; reached number one on the Billboard Hot 100 chart. 

For a more comprehensive view, here are some of the artists and bands with notable chart-topping hits in 1973:

- **The Rolling Stones**: &quot;Angie&quot;
