- **Paul McCartney &amp; Wings**: &quot;My Love&quot;
- **Jim Croce**: &quot;Bad, Bad Leroy Brown&quot; and &quot;Time in a Bottle&quot;
- **Tony Orlando and Dawn**: &quot;Tie a Yellow Ribbon Round the Ole Oak Tree&quot;

While these artists aren&#x27;t all traditional rock bands, they dominated the charts with number one hits in 1973.

